STEP 1 download docker-compose.yml
$ curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/appwrite/grafana-oncall/v1.24.14/docker-compose.yml -o docker-compose.yml
exit=0

STEP 2 write .env: DOMAIN, COMPOSE_PROFILES=with_grafana, SECRET_KEY
